  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - Oh good. You are finally awake.
    - ... {freezePlayer}
    - ...You VeilWood residents always seem to have your memory fail you, so let
      me remind you how things work here.
    - You are responsible for providing this hamlet sustenance through the crops
      you cultivate here.
    - Anything you grow, you bring to me. In return, I will give you <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color>
      <sprite index=0>.
    - You can spend these <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color> <sprite index=0> however you
      please. But be sure you are earning your daily quota.
    - I see you have come prepared with some Pale Carrot seeds.
    - Only under the gaze of twilight will they grow, and you must pay extra mind
      none of the wildlife makes a meal out of them.
    - I expect a bountiful harvest...
    - Do not disappoint.
    emotions: 01000000060000000200000000000000010000000000000004000000050000000000000003000000
